<feedback-toast message="{{error}}" binddismiss="onFeedbackDismiss" />
<view class="page">
  <view class="title">各位秘书协商</view>
  <view class="subtitle">各自考虑主人的安排，共同寻找讨论时间。</view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{state}}">
    <view class="card-title">参与协商的秘书</view>
    <view wx:for="{{state.members}}" wx:key="index" class="member"><text>{{item.name}}{{item.isMe ? '（我）' : ''}}</text><text>{{item.authorized ? '秘书已就绪' : '暂不可协商'}}</text></view>
    <view class="muted spaced">加入圆桌后秘书自动参与。本人秘书可读取相关日期的日程名称、时间与偏好并发送给已配置模型；其他成员只看到协商结果。退出或被移除后停止参与。</view>
    <picker wx:if="{{state.isOwner}}" range="{{activityNames}}" value="{{activityIndex}}" bindchange="onActivity" disabled="{{busy || state.run.status === 'RUNNING'}}"><view class="field">本次类型：{{activityNames[activityIndex]}} · 点击选择</view></picker>
    <view wx:if="{{state.isOwner}}" class="muted spaced">请按实际活动选择；“仅娱乐”的规则只在选择娱乐活动时生效。默认不会额外增加限制。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{!state.enabled}}" class="notice">后台尚未接入真实模型。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{state.members.length < 2 || state.members.length > 5}}" class="notice">支持2至5位成员，加入后自动参与。</view>
    <button wx:if="{{state.isOwner}}" class="primary" bindtap="start" disabled="{{busy || !state.enabled || !state.roomOpen || state.members.length < 2 || state.members.length > 5 || state.run.status === 'RUNNING'}}">{{state.run.status === 'RUNNING' ? '秘书正在协商…' : '开始协商（最多5轮）'}}</button>
  </view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{state.run}}">
    <view class="card-title">{{state.run.status === 'RUNNING' ? '协商进行中' : state.run.status === 'READY' ? '等待主人确认' : '需要主人处理'}}</view>
    <bounded-scroll watch-data="{{state.run}}">
    <view class="notice">{{state.run.message}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{state.run.activityKind}}" class="muted">本次类型：{{state.run.activityKind}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{state.run.explanation.length}}" class="spaced"><view class="card-title">本人的方案核对（仅你可见）</view><view wx:for="{{state.run.explanation}}" wx:key="index" class="muted spaced">{{item}}</view></view>
    <view wx:for="{{state.run.events}}" wx:key="index" class="event"><view class="muted">第{{item.round}}轮 · {{item.speaker}}</view><view class="spaced">{{item.text}}</view></view>
    </bounded-scroll>
  </view>
  <view class="muted spaced">工具读取和时间提议来自真实执行；共享消息由程序生成，不公开任何私人偏好或日程标题。候选最多216个，不代表所有可行时段。</view>
  <button class="secondary" bindtap="back">返回圆桌 / 确认方案</button>
</view>
